    }
  '''
}

docs {
  # Connect WebSocket (Bearer Header)

  **Protocol:** `WebSocket` (`ws://` / `wss://`)
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/ws`
  **Auth:** Header `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` (Access Token)

  ## Description
  Non-browser handshake flow (mobile apps, CLI clients, Bruno, Postman) passing the JWT access token in the standard `Authorization` header.

  Upon connection, the server emits `ws.connected` and streams all real-time notifications for the authenticated user automatically.

  ## Prerequisite
  Run `Auth -> 05. Login (Identifier + Password)` first so `{{token}}` is populated.

  ## Errors (HTTP JSON before upgrade)
  * `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Missing or malformed `Authorization: Bearer` header
  * `401 TOKEN_EXPIRED` — Access token expired
  * `401 TOKEN_INVALID` — Invalid signature or wrong token type
  * `401 TOKEN_REVOKED` — Token has been revoked
}
